      "to_vss": "x 6.894757, rounded; index 1..4 = front-left, front-right, rear-left, rear-right. A naming choice, not a fact: twin.ottoq_sim_emit_telemetry draws the four values independently (34 + 4 x a seeded uniform, salts tire0..tire3) with no wheel position, so any order is equally true of the twin. A real operator states its own."
